{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26906","headline":"游昊天玄都观 · 姚合","name":"游昊天玄都观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"性同相见易，紫府共闲行。\n阴径红桃落，秋坛白石生。\n藓文连竹色，鹤语应松声。\n风定药香细，树声泉气清。\n垂檐灵草影，遶壁古山名。\n围外坊无禁，归时踏月明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}